cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Nhat Nguyet: open source code and data for Zi Wei Dou Shu, BaZi and numerology"
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below. Credit line: Data: Nhat Nguyet (nhatnguyet.org)."
